      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;configure-development-environment&#34;&gt;Configure Development Environment&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install Terraform and go
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I used the version in the default Ubuntu apt repos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using ZSH
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are using zsh I recommend adding the following line to your &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;code&gt;export PATH=&amp;quot;$PATH:$(go env GOPATH)/bin&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://stackoverflow.com/questions/42614380/go-install-not-working-with-zsh&#34;&gt;Credits to mmik in this post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
